  "content": "<p>這個簡單的材質更新將<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" rel=\"nofollow\">儲物抽屜模組</a>的紋理現代化，使其符合新版 Jappa 1.14+ 的視覺風格。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>支援版本</strong></p><ul>\n<li>1.21.1</li>\n<li>1.20.1</li>\n<li>1.19</li>\n<li>1.18</li>\n<li>1.16</li>\n<li>1.12</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fI3I410P9Q1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"196\" height=\"50\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UV0z4K.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/anQZraw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"664\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W0cee8j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"664\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0N6x1G1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"664\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iw1MIpK.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/blinking-ender-eyes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZniwvvZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"63\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/baby-animals-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2eR3FW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mob-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrkE2a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-halloween-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PwGFKBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-fall-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><